The agent role prompts and the orchestrator routing table in
skills/*/SKILL.md are adapted and translated from the corresponding
prompts in oh-my-opencode-slim (src/agents/*.ts, MIT licensed).

This project is an independent re-implementation for the ZCode CLI:
it is pure markdown files with no compiled code, and it shares no
TypeScript/runtime code with oh-my-opencode-slim (only prompt text is
adapted, as stated above). It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by alvinunreal, Boring Dystopia Development, or OpenCode.

